    "Realtime.messages parent ONLY indexes, composite id+inserted_at PK and partial broadcast replay (topic/expiration) differ from subscription entity/hashed filter uniqueness. Parent-only does not prove a missing partition index; child partitions and parent keys require separate check.",
    "Storage.objects index variants distinguish case-sensitive name COLLATE C, lower(name), prefix text_pattern_ops, NULLS NOT DISTINCT version, archived/current/delete-marker predicates and lifecycle timestamps. Similar columns do not prove redundant indexes.",
